ssets/steam/apps/3818000/extras/eb331dcc425cb3103cdb6e7cc7edd0a4.mp4?t=1774582643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your goal is to kill as many demons as possible before the timer runs out. You can extend the timer by breaking hourglasses scattered throughout each stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Killing demons quickly starts a combo chain: the higher the combo, the higher the score. Killing demons quickly enough makes the nun enter in &quot;Holy Time&quot;mode, Making her a psychopath, her guns stronger and allowing you gain bonus points during that state.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818000/extras/bb05ba3ca914c2c7bedb70330a1209e4.avif?t=1774582643\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818000/extras/c2e55aaedeaf7952b1c1edab92d98cd6.poster.avif?t=1774582643\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818000/extras/c2e55aaedeaf7952b1c1edab92d98cd6.webm?t=1774582643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818000/extras/c2e55aaedeaf7952b1c1edab92d98cd6.mp4?t=1774582643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gravity system that creates unique maps to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure arcade fun, no ammo or complex story, just gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven bizarre environments, each inspired by a deadly sin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique set of enemies per map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great melodic rock music for each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver immaculate damage and pain to demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low poly aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven weapons to try out and have fun with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Angelica Amadeus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818000/extras/511af5d70e6953f68075442a80193f4a.avif?t=1774582643\" width=1600 height=1391 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["RM120"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818000/657f4eb3eeb0f4e52771fd0ee76fbd725d3be702/header.jpg?t=1774582643","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818000/983181006/7757098f8fee4fcdf274d9b6026a3405189411cf/1773661284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773661736","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818000/983181006/7757098f8fee4fcdf274d9b6026a3405189411cf/1773661284/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773661736","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818000/983181006/7757098f8fee4fcdf274d9b6026a3405189411cf/1773661284/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773661736","id":257304366,"name":"Official Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257304366/73c16f87d896208c0be86b4736195761700c3ee9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773661736"}],"name":"Guns and Nuns: Storming Hell","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600X Six-Core Processor  3.60 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>G